<title>USA: Springettsbury, Pa., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Springettsbury, Pa., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp said it won $9.080 million of Springettsbury, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.116 percent including the cost of insurance.</p>
</text>
